        "content_wjEDe": {
          "type": "content",
          "disabled": false,
          "settings": {
            "title": "CAN I HOLD MY ORDER IN STOCK?",
            "content": "<p>To hold your order, simply tick \"Hold my order in stock for up to 90 days\" at checkout and select your desired hold date. </p><p>Alternatively, you can email <a href=\"mailto:hello@williamwoodmirrors.co.uk\" target=\"_blank\">hello@williamwoodmirrors.co.uk</a> after placing your order, quoting your order number and the date you want to hold your order until. An advisor will be happy to assist you.</p><p></p><p><strong>PLEASE NOTE: </strong>We can only hold orders for up to 90 days from the date of your purchase.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
