        "liquid_7igpU": {
          "type": "liquid",
          "disabled": false,
          "settings": {
            "title": "Delivery Information",
            "liquid": "<style>\n\n  @media (max-width: 768px) {\n    .mobile-only {\n      display: block;\n    }\n  .desktop-only {\n    display: none !important;\n  }\n  }\n\n  @media (min-width: 769px) {\n    .desktop-only {\n      display: block;\n    }\n  .mobile-only {\n    display: none !important;\n  }\n  }\n</style>\n\n<img class=\"mobile-only\" src=\"https://sfycdn.speedsize.com/19bba31a-6c36-4510-aa4c-90e87768362d/cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0780/3843/files/WW_24_DeliveryProcess_v1.0-01_1_0b99d0aa-da83-4a21-8fa3-52abeac4567f.jpg?v=1724769745\" alt=\"Delivery Process\">\n\n<img class=\"desktop-only\" src=\"https://sfycdn.speedsize.com/19bba31a-6c36-4510-aa4c-90e87768362d/cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0780/3843/files/WW_24_DeliveryProcess_v1.0-02_1_cfb636aa-febe-4f2b-96d1-ae01b1f9a88e.jpg?v=1724769745\" alt=\"Delivery Process\">\n\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">MAINLAND UK + NORTHERN IRELAND</strong></p>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><br data-mce-fragment=\"1\"></strong>Free Mainland UK Delivery within 1-7 Business Days. We will contact you with advance notice to organise a delivery date.<br data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><br data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Free Northern Ireland Delivery within 14-21 Business Days. We will contact you with advance notice to organise a delivery date.<strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><br data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><br data-mce-fragment=\"1\"></strong></p>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">NORTH WEST</strong><br data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><br data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Free Express 1-4 Business Days to the following post codes:<br data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><br data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">BL, L, M, OL, SK, WA, WN.</strong></p>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><br data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><br data-mce-fragment=\"1\">LONDON</strong><br data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><br data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Free Express 1-4 Business Days to the following post codes:<br data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><br data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">NW, N, E, SE, SW, W, WC, EC, WD, EN, IG, BR, CR, SM, KT, TW, UB, HA.</strong></p>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><br data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><br data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Remainder of the UK</strong><br data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><br data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Free UK Delivery within 1-9 Business Days to the following post codes:.<br data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><br data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">AB, BA, CA, DD, DG, DT, EX, FK, IP, IV1, IV2, IV3, IV5, IV8, IV9, IV10, IV12, IV13, IV30, IV31, IV32, IV36, KY, LA, LD, LL, LN, NR, PE, PH1-PH26, PL, SA, SY, TA, TQ, TR</strong></p>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><br data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><br data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><br data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">PRE ORDER ITEM(S) DELIVERY<br data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><br data-mce-fragment=\"1\"></strong><p>Your Pre Order items will be shipped urgently within the specified week. You can find this week above the 'ADD TO CART' button. Our highly acclaimed Pre Order service lets you reserve in-demand stock. You can cancel anytime, <strong>100% refund guarantee</strong>.\n<br><br>\nFor orders with both in-stock and Pre Order items, we will ship the in-stock items first, within the usual time. Once your Pre Order items are available, we’ll send them promptly to you upon arrival to our warehouse.</p>"
          }
        },
        "liquid_Gc6DA": {
          "type": "liquid",
          "disabled": false,
          "settings": {
            "title": "Easy Returns + 100% Money Back Guarantee",
            "liquid": "<style>\n  @media (max-width: 768px) {\n    .mobile-only {\n      display: block;\n    }\n    .desktop-only {\n      display: none !important;\n    }\n  }\n\n  @media (min-width: 769px) {\n    .desktop-only {\n      display: block;\n    }\n    .mobile-only {\n      display: none !important;\n    }\n  }\n</style>\n\n<img class=\"mobile-only\" src=\"https://sfycdn.speedsize.com/19bba31a-6c36-4510-aa4c-90e87768362d/cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0780/3843/files/WW_24_ReturnProcess_v1.0-02_7a52876d-f8cd-46c3-aac5-5313191965c3.jpg?v=1724769745\" alt=\"Returns Process\">\n\n<img class=\"desktop-only\" src=\"https://sfycdn.speedsize.com/19bba31a-6c36-4510-aa4c-90e87768362d/cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0780/3843/files/WW_24_ReturnProcess_v1.0-01_1.jpg?v=1724151843\" alt=\"Returns Process\">\n\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\">We offer a&nbsp;<strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">100% Money Back Guarantee</strong>&nbsp;on all orders, including a&nbsp;<strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">90</strong>&nbsp;Day Hassle-Free&nbsp;Returns<span data-mce-fragment=\"1\">&nbsp;</span></strong>. To initiate your return and claim your 100% refund, simply head to your&nbsp;<strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Customer Portal</strong>&nbsp;and select 'Request a return' or email&nbsp;<strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">hello@williamwoodmirrors.co.uk</strong>&nbsp;with your order number. Our Customer Support Team will get back to you as soon as possible with the next steps.</p>\n\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><br data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">INDUSTRY-LEADING INSTANT REFUND SERVICE</strong><br data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><br data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Experience our industry-leading Instant Refund Service (Maximum wait time for your refund: 1 Business Day). We ensure a prompt, 100% money back refund on all returns.</p>\n\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Once your return is collected, a notification will be sent to our Customer Support Team, and your 100% refund will be processed instantly. If your return is collected outside of working hours (8 AM - 4 PM, Monday - Friday), you will receive your refund the next business day – that's our promise.<br data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><br data-mce-fragment=\"1\">For more information about our Returns &amp; Exchanges, click&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.williamwoodmirrors.co.uk/pages/returns\" title=\"https://www.williamwoodmirrors.co.uk/pages/returns\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">here</a>.</p>\n\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><br data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Need more help? Feel free to contact our Customer Support Team via&nbsp;<strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">hello@williamwoodmirrors.co.uk</strong>, and one of our advisors will be happy to assist you.</p>"
          }
        },
